[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2533445744","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99447#issuecomment-2533445744","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99447","id":2533445744,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XAVBw","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-11T01:55:31Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T01:55:31Z","body":"I am confused by a related question: \nIs it safe to copy one project's addons which contain some .uid files to another project? What if the uids are already exist in the target project?\nOr do we need to add .uid into `.gitignore` file if we use a version control tool? Do we need to delete .uid files after we copy scripts from an old project into a new project?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2533445744/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2533546092","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99447#issuecomment-2533546092","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99447","id":2533546092,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XAths","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-11T03:28:28Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T03:28:28Z","body":"Each generated .uid file is unique, so if you copy them between projects they will work as expected.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2533546092/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2533598839","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99447#issuecomment-2533598839","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99447","id":2533598839,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XA6Z3","user":{"login":"jinyangcruise","id":42859362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODU5MzYy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42859362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyangcruise","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyangcruise/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-11T04:22:44Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T04:22:44Z","body":"Thanks, I checked the code:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/cf038deb1033007167a05a4518a0e8b2dae5e93e/core/io/resource_uid.cpp#L88-L100\n\nI can understand the newly generated uid won't be the same as existing uids in a project, but there are some chances that two projects generate the same uid, aren't there?\n\nImagine this situation:\nProject A: `a.gd.uid` which content is `uid://4pmd34mck18a`, \nProject B: `b.gd.uid` which content is also `uid://4pmd34mck18a` ,\nWhen copying `a.gd` and `a.gd.uid` into Project B, some error will occur.\n\nIn fact, for a long time, I have the same concern about copying files like `.tscn` from one project to another project because I fear that the resource ids in `.tscn` will accidentally be same as those in the target project. The newly introduced `.uid` file raised my concern again. \n\nI can't do much to `.tscn`, `.tres` files but I can add .uid into `.gitignore` especially for addons if I want to share them with others but I don't know if this is even necessary or a good idea. Do you have any suggestions?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2533598839/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2535904838","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99447#issuecomment-2535904838","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99447","id":2535904838,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XJtZG","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-11T12:50:14Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T12:50:14Z","body":"> there are some chances that two projects generate the same uid, aren't there?\n\nThere are, but very very low. I think the editor can already deal with duplicate UIDs to some extent, but we can improve it. It's unlikely to be a problem though.\n\n> I can add .uid into .gitignore especially for addons if I want to share them with others but I don't know if this is even necessary or a good idea.\n\nIt's not necessary, but it would work. Note however that scenes automatically refer to files by both path and UID, so if you don't provide script's UID and that script is referenced in a scene, you will get an error while loading. The editor is able to fix UID by checking the path, but the error (warning) is still being printed.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2535904838/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]